## Próximos Passos

1. Configurar OIDC no AWS (uma vez):
   ```bash
   aws iam create-openid-connect-provider \
     --url https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com \
     --client-id-list sts.amazonaws.com
   ```

2. Adicionar secrets em GitHub:
   - Settings → Environments → production
   - Adicionar `AWS_ROLE_ARN`, `AWS_ECR_REGISTRY`

3. Ajustar `ci-cd.yml`:
   - Cluster ECS name (`chegii-production`)
   - Service name (`chegii-app`)
   - ECR registry

4. Testar PR:
   ```bash
   git checkout -b test/ci
   git push origin test/ci
   # Abrir PR, ver workflow rodar
   ```

